    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">&quot;What does it take to forgive the unforgivable?&quot;</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">&quot;Perhaps the answer is time... a very, very long time...&quot;</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kleopatra is a cyberpunk action RPG with arcade shooter combat and a bittersweet narrative about time and forgiveness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Hatori, an imperial agent sent to the lawless asteroid city Kleopatra, you are tasked with a mission from a mysterious master: Find and capture Espada.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To complete your mission, you must shoot and slash your way through violent biker gangs at war over a strange, reality-warping substance named TDE.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you will enlist the help of a bounty hunter named Klover and uncover past secrets which will call into question your master's motivations.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quickly shoot and slash to clear all enemy waves before your health or time runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use abilities to slow down enemy attacks or dodge at the last moment to avoid damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different enemy types will have their own attack patterns and defenses to break through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn credits through bounties and shop for mods to create chain reaction attack combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get higher bounty scores to unlock scenes with dialogue choices and fleeting romance.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game can be played with mouse and keyboard or with gamepad.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mouse and keyboard: Aim by moving mouse cursor over target.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gamepad: Aim by selecting target with D-pad, works on Steam Deck.</p></li></ul>",
